# Search tools (ripgrep, and Claude Code's Grep, which uses it) skip anything in
# .gitignore. projects/ and company/ are gitignored so the harness never commits
# them, but the agent still has to search them. This file lets it. Each project's
# own .gitignore still applies inside it, so node_modules and builds stay out.
!/projects/
!/projects/*
!/company/
!/company/*
